; CINEMATIC_PRELUDE_V2
; Bito original runtime source. Art integration and MUGEN engine test remain external.
; Vars: 0 extra-jump used; 1 highjump latch; 2 jump direction; 9 observed HitCount.
; 20 cached AI attack; 21 cached AI guard; 22 cached AI approach; 23 cached AI jump.
; 40 air-combo victim ID; 41 actual airborne hit count; 58 current owned tick stamp.
